The '''Cat Scratcher''' is a lottery introduced in [[Version 10.7 Update|version 10.7]]. During certain seasonal events, players may access it from the [[Cat Base]], above the [[Splash Text]]. When opened, a player will be able to scratch off a silver patch, revealing a random prize (as listed below). Each week during the event, players can scratch a new patch on the ticket to earn more [[Cat Food]].

Players can scratch off 1 of 3 lottery patches for the following prizes:
