==Trivia==
*The whale-like cat next to the Li'l Cat Scratcher's logo resembles the [[wikipedia:日本宝くじ協会|Japan Lottery Association]] mascot character [https://www.takarakuji-official.jp/assets/img/common/img-qoo002.png?param=1607619414000 Kū-chan] (クーちゃん).
*The cards mention a "TOO BAD" outcome with a "Scrub Brush" reward (i.e., nothing), but no such outcome can occur in-game.

